        "d": "Lima, Peru vinyl obsessive Salvatore Dellepiane shares selections from his treasure trove of rare and obscure boogie and funk from all across the world.\nFrom the host: \"A selection of funk, disco, and soul from across the globe, bringing together records from the US, Peru, Chile, Panama, Nigeria, Ghana, Italy, Brazil, and beyond. The mix moves through different rhythms and styles but stays rooted in groove, focusing mostly on obscure and lesser-known records.\"",
